{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56064","headline":"法身颂 · 慧坚","name":"法身颂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"扶桑出日头，黄河辊底流。\n六六三十六，陕府出（《五灯会元》作「灌」）铁牛。\n（《天圣广灯录》卷二十四、《五灯会元》卷十四。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"慧坚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56064.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56064","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}